# DECM Core Conventions

## Project Setup
- **Package Manager**: pnpm only (v9.15.0) - never npm/yarn/bun
- **Frontend**: React 19 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Radix UI
- **Backend**: Go Fiber + PostgreSQL + sqlc
- **Monorepo**: Turbo + pnpm workspaces

## Backend (Go) Conventions

### File Structure
```
apps/backend/
├── core-api/cmd/main.go          # Entry point
├── core-api/internal/            # Private code (handlers, entities, repos, usecases)
├── services/auth/, /oauth/       # Shared services
└── common/                        # Shared utilities
```

### Key Patterns
- **Handler Pattern**: Parse → Validate → UseCase → Response
- **Layers**: Handler → UseCase → Repository → Database
- **Scripts Naming**: Use `*:core` (e.g., `dev:core`, `build:core`), never `backend`
- **OpenAPI**: All handlers must include `@Summary`, `@Description`, `@Router` annotations

### Database & SQL
- **PII Encryption**: Always use pgcrypto: `pgp_sym_encrypt(data, key::varchar)`
- **sqlc Parameters**: Cast encryption_key with `::varchar` in ALL queries

## Frontend (React/TypeScript) Conventions

### Project Structure
```
apps/web/src/
├── pages/              # Route components (page-level)
├── components/         # Reusable UI components
├── hooks/              # Custom React hooks
├── services/           # API client, utilities
├── lib/                # Helper functions
└── config/             # Feature flags, constants
```

### Code Quality
- **ESLint**: Strict TypeScript, no `any` type
- **Testing**: React Testing Library + Vitest, 70% minimum coverage
- **API Client**: Generate with `pnpm gen-api:core` from OpenAPI

## Essential Commands
```bash
# Setup
pnpm install              # Install deps
pnpm compose:up           # Start PostgreSQL

# Development
pnpm dev                  # Frontend (localhost:3000)
pnpm dev:core             # Backend (localhost:8080/api/v1)
pnpm gen-api:core         # Generate TypeScript client

# Quality
pnpm lint                 # ESLint + TypeScript check
pnpm lint -- --fix        # Auto-fix
pnpm test                 # Tests
pnpm test --coverage      # Coverage

# Database
pnpm db:generate          # sqlc: SQL → Go
pnpm db:migrate           # Migrations
```

## Security
- **Auth**: Wallet signing + JWT sessions (HTTP-only cookies)
- **PII**: Encrypted at DB layer with pgcrypto
- **Type Safety**: sqlc generates safe Go code
- **Validation**: Input validation on all requests

## Dev Endpoints
- Frontend: http://localhost:3000
- Backend: http://localhost:8080/api/v1
- API Docs: http://localhost:8080/swagger/
- Database: localhost:5432

